# Final Vengeance: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature or enchantment. Exile target creature." Bot1's Swamp and
# Mox Emerald are a land and a noncreature artifact, nothing to sacrifice (CR 118.8), so it can't be cast (the refusal). With
# Ornithopter out it can; a Swamp is no creature to target (refused); aimed at Bot2's Hired Blade it exiles it instead of putting it into
# a graveyard (CR 701.13a), and the sacrificed Ornithopter goes to Bot1's graveyard.

